@startuml patient_assignment_workflow
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title Wi-Fi setup — current sequence
actor "Operator / phone" as op
participant "Controller / communication" as dev
participant "L1 Wi-Fi adapter" as wifi
database "Flash settings" as flash
dev -> flash : read saved credentials
alt saved credentials
 dev -> wifi : join; wait for selected network address\n4 attempts total; 5 s between failures
 note right of dev : Boot exhaustion: error; 2 s hold in Idle.\nLink-loss exhaustion: automatic setup in Idle.
end
opt no credentials or setup requested in Idle
 dev -> wifi : scan/cache (4 attempts total)
 dev -> wifi : open AP; start portal
 op -> dev : join open hotspot; QR opens portal URL
 dev --> op : selection; password only if protected
 op -> dev : Connect
 dev --> op : request queued; poll status
 dev -> wifi : one join; confirm selected network + address
 alt join failed
  dev --> op : show failure
  dev -> wifi : rescan with AP open
  dev --> op : new list after scan-finished
 else joined
  dev -> flash : store credentials; retry once
  alt both saves failed
   dev --> op : save warning; connection retained
  else saved
   dev --> op : success
  end
  dev -> dev : 10 s result display
  dev -> wifi : stop portal/AP; retain station
 end
end
note over op, flash
 Cancel/timeout: notice then cleanup, keep an established station.
 Start: safely stop setup before audio; keep existing association.
 Wi-Fi-only failures preserve working audio; counted feedback follows catalogue.
 Time, secure server transport and Device registration are later FHIR work.
 See wifi-state / wifi-flow for complete recovery and global rules.
end note
@enduml
